DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260812T163000
UID:6a1f05482ea730c17ab3a961@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join our English Conversation Circle and practice your English
  by speaking with others developing their English skills\nThe sessions ru
 n twice a month on every 2nd and 4th Wednesday of each month from 3-4:30 a
